flowchart TB
accTitle: Durable job references feed elastic long-running workers
accDescr: Uploaded files remain in S3 while an SQS job reference is processed by a scaled EC2 worker. The worker commits output before deleting the message.
U[Portal upload]:::inputData --> B[(S3 input files)]:::storage
U -->|Object key| Q[(SQS job queue)]:::storage
Q --> W[EC2 worker<br/>Up to 30 minutes per job]:::process
B -->|Read input| W
W --> O[(S3 committed output)]:::storage
O --> D[Delete completed queue message]:::output
M[Backlog per instance<br/>Scale-in protection while busy]:::reference -.-> W
